# A table indexed by a field that is not a finite set of string constants.
-- source.cue --
t: string
-- target.cue --
u: 1 | 2
-- lens.cue --
_T: {a: 1, b: 2}
input: _
result: {u: _T[input.t]}
-- out --
unknown
result.u indexes a table by input.t, which may be string rather than one of a finite set of string constants; the checker needs every possible key (rule unknown-table-key) @ lens.cue:3:13
